#: conf.json:strings.momentum.title.Rising
msgid "Rising: the score grew by at least 10 points and at least 10% in 30 days."
msgstr "上升：30 天内分数增加至少 10 分，且至少 10%。"

#: conf.json:strings.momentum.title.Cooling
msgid "Cooling: the score fell by at least 10 points and at least 10% in 30 days."
msgstr "降温：30 天内分数下降至少 10 分，且至少 10%。"

#: conf.json:strings.momentum.title.Stable
msgid "Stable: the score changed by less than 10 points or less than 10% in 30 days."
msgstr "稳定：30 天内分数变化不足 10 分或不足 10%。"

#: conf.json:strings.momentum.title.New
msgid "New: the first release is less than 30 days old, so there is nothing to compare with."
msgstr "新包：首次发布不足 30 天，没有可比较的历史。"

#: conf.json:strings.momentum.explain
msgid "The score was {before} 30 days ago and is {now} now ({change}): {label}."
msgstr "30 天前分数为 {before}，现在为 {now}（{change}）：{label}。"

#: conf.json:strings.momentum.explainNew
msgid "The package had no release 30 days ago."
msgstr "30 天前这个包还没有发布。"

#: conf.json:strings.momentum.downloads
msgid "Downloads grew from {before} to {now} in the same period."
msgstr "同期下载量从 {before} 增加到 {now}。"

#: conf.json:strings.momentum.noDownloadHistory
msgid "Download counts from 30 days ago are not recorded yet, so the comparison uses today's downloads for both points and only dependencies and release age can change the score."
msgstr "尚未记录 30 天前的下载量，因此两个时间点都使用今天的下载量，只有依赖关系和发布时间会改变分数。"

